ups\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"method\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>Method</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">4</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalangleinterval_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"gethorizontalangleinterval gets the angular interval of horizontal obstacle ranging data, which is an angular interval around the aircraft at 360 degrees in the horizontal direction.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getHorizontalAngleInterval</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Gets the angular interval of horizontal obstacle ranging data, which is an angular interval around the aircraft at 360 degrees in the horizontal direction.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalobstacledistance_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"gethorizontalobstacledistance gets horizontal obstacle ranging data.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getHorizontalObstacleDistance</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Gets horizontal obstacle ranging data.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getupwardobstacledistance_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getupwardobstacledistance gets the distance measurement data of upward obstacles.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getUpwardObstacleDistance</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Gets the distance measurement data of upward obstacles.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getdownwardobstacledistance_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getdownwardobstacledistance gets the distance measurement data of downward obstacles.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getDownwardObstacleDistance</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Gets the distance measurement data of downward obstacles.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">No matching members. Try a shorter keyword.</div></div>\n<h4 id=\"Members\">Members</h4>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalangleinterval\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalangleinterval_inline\">getHorizontalAngleInterval</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalangleinterval_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getHorizontalAngleInterval</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getHorizontalAngleInterval</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.aircraft.perception.data</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Gets the angular interval of horizontal obstacle ranging data, which is an angular interval around the aircraft at 360 degrees in the horizontal direction. for example:<br>\nIf the value is 1, it means that <code><a href=\"IPerceptionManager_ObstacleData.html#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalobstacledistance\">getHorizontalObstacleDistance</a></code> has 360 data (360/1) of horizontal obstacle ranging data obtained.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">int</font></code></td><td>Returns the angular interval of horizontal obstacle ranging data.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalobstacledistance\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalobstacledistance_inline\">getHorizontalObstacleDistance</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalobstacledistance_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getHorizontalObstacleDistance</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">List</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><span class=\"jv-type\">Integer</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getHorizontalObstacleDistance</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.aircraft.perception.data</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Gets horizontal obstacle ranging data. Unit: millimeter. The angular interval of the horizontal obstacle ranging data can be obtained through <code><a href=\"IPerceptionManager_ObstacleData.html#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalangleinterval\">getHorizontalAngleInterval</a></code>.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">List&lt;Integer&gt;</font></code></td><td>Returns horizontal obstacle ranging data.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getupwardobstacledistance\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getupwardobstacledistance_inline\">getUpwardObstacleDistance</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getupwardobstacledistance_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getUpwardObstacleDistance</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getUpwardObstacleDistance</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.aircraft.perception.data</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Gets the distance measurement data of upward obstacles. Unit: millimeter. Indicates the distance between the aircraft and the upward obstacle.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">int</font></code></td><td>Returns upward obstacle ranging data.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getdownwardobstacledistance\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getdownwardobstacledistance_inline\">getDownwardObstacleDistance</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getdownwardobstacledistance_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getDownwardObstacleDistance</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getDownwardObstacleDistance</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.aircraft.perception.data</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Gets the distance measurement data of downward obstacles. Unit: millimeter. Indicates the distance between the aircraft and the downward obstacle.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">int</font></code></td><td>Returns the downward obstacle ranging data.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\">\n      </font></font></font>","tocHtml":"\n        <div class=\"site-toc-inner\">\n          <div class=\"site-toc-title\">On this page</div>\n          <ul data-static-toc=\"true\" class=\"site-toc-list\"><li><a href=\"#ifm-overview\" data-target=\"ifm-overview\">Overview</a></li><li><a href=\"#Class-Members\" data-target=\"ifm-members-nav\">Member Index</a></li><li class=\"toc-group\"><span class=\"toc-group-title\">Methods</span></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalangleinterval\" data-target=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalangleinterval\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>getHorizontalAngleInterval</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalobstacledistance\" data-target=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalobstacledistance\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>getHorizontalObstacleDistance</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getupwardobstacledistance\" data-target=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getupwardobstacledistance\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>getUpwardObstacleDistance</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getdownwardobstacledistance\" da